  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAs">III As</ref> 7.2</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="7.2" corresp="#wit-q">Et si prepositus alicui hominum eorum concredere non audeat, inueniat XII plegios cognationis sue, qui ei stent in fideiussione sua.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#attenborough" n="7.2" corresp="#wit-q">[Et si præpositus alicui eorum hominum concredere non audeat, inveniat XII plegios cognationis suæ, qui ei stent in fideiussione sua.] [Q/Br, Q/M ]</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-q">And if there is any of those men whom the reeve dare not trust, he shall find twelve supporters from among his kindred, who will stand as security for him.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Latin only; no German translation in Liebermann. 7.2 is missing from K (Liebermann's base MS) and added in the margin of Co.</note>
      </div>
